# This project currently requires NO environment variables or secrets.
# There is no contact form and no backend, so there is nothing to protect.
#
# If you add something later that needs a key (e.g. an analytics provider,
# or a form service), copy this file to `.env.local`, fill in real values,
# and NEVER commit `.env.local` to Git (it is already in .gitignore).
#
# Example of the pattern to follow:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=
